  "label": "Poggy Emotes",
  "tagline": "330 emotes, a search box, favourites, a live preview character, and a Nearby tab for the chairs, bars and props around you",
  "category": "Roleplay",
  "description": "A searchable emote menu with over 330 animations, scenarios and prop emotes. Players star the ones they use, see their recent picks first, and watch a stand-in character act each one out before they commit to it. The Nearby tab lists what the player can do with the things around them (sit on that chair, stand at the bar, lean on that railing); pick one and the character walks over and does it.",
